[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 3.0.8 (Build 40) — Discovery Unleashed[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Google Play Store Rollout, Dedicated Feed Companion & Google Discover Integration[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Hey everyone!

We are excited to share a major milestone update for [B]Expressive Launcher[/B]! With [B]Version 3.0.8 (Build 40)[/B], the launcher is now rolling out through the Google Play Store, alongside our new official standalone [B]Expressive Feed Companion[/B] app for seamless, native Google Discover integration.

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New in 3.0.8 (Build 40)[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Google Play Store Distribution:[/B] Expressive Launcher is now officially automated and deployed to Google Play ([ICODE]com.denson9874.Expressive_Launcher_L3[/ICODE], Build 40).
[*][B]Dedicated Expressive Feed Companion:[/B] Because Google Play policies do not permit launchers published on the Play Store to bundle private AIDL overlay services directly, we created a lightweight, battery-friendly companion application ([ICODE]dev.launcher.expressive.feed[/ICODE]) that bridges the Google App Discover feed to Expressive Launcher.
[*][B]Resolved Package Installer Collision (INSTALL_FAILED_DUPLICATE_PERMISSION):[/B] Fixed an issue where Android's package installer displayed [I]"App not installed"[/I] due to a signature permission clash between Google Play App Signing and sideloaded certificates. The companion now installs effortlessly across all Android 12 through Android 17 devices.
[*][B]Cryptographic Developer Signature Bridge:[/B] Updated the launcher's verification engine to recognize our verified Google Developer key ([ICODE]2aa9f1bf3dbd2d5bd27ad7516f1caf1b8a18e15f6d59858a37282784bb2acba7[/ICODE]). This eliminates the [I]"belongs to a different version"[/I] prompt and enables the [B]Show Google Discover[/B] toggle directly in Home Settings.
[*][B]Simplified GitHub Release:[/B] Cleaned up the release assets so there is now only a single official file ([ICODE]ExpressiveFeed.apk[/ICODE]), plus an instant web portal for direct downloads.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]📲 How to Set Up Google Discover[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*][B]Install Expressive Launcher:[/B] Update to Version 3.0.8 (Build 40) via the Google Play Store (Internal Testing track).
[*][B]Download the Companion:[/B] Grab [B]ExpressiveFeed.apk[/B] from our [URL="https://denson9874.github.io/ExpressiveLauncher/feed/"]GitHub Pages Portal[/URL] or [URL="https://github.com/denson9874/ExpressiveLauncher/releases/tag/feed-companion-v37"]GitHub Releases[/URL].
[*][B]Install the APK:[/B] Tap the download notification to install it on your device.
[*][B]Enable in Settings:[/B] Long-press your home screen &gt; [B]Home Settings[/B] &gt; [B]Google Discover[/B].
[*][B]Enjoy:[/B] Switch on [B]Show Google Discover[/B], return to your home screen, and swipe right!
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

